<div id="readability-page-1" class="page"><div data-hpc="true" containertiming="hpc"><article itemprop="text">
<p dir="auto">A reasoning Jev-style classifier with a diffusion drafter, trained with SFT and CISPO.</p>
<p dir="auto"><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://github.com/PostHog/jeeves/blob/master/assets/smug.png"><img src="https://github.com/PostHog/jeeves/raw/master/assets/smug.png" alt="Jeeves" width="220"></a></p>
<p dir="auto">
